## Graphics & Visual Design Attribution (CC BY-SA 3.0)

The colonial building architectures, market stall color palettes, terrain compositions,
and settlement visual motifs in `src/render/canvasRenderer.ts` reference and are adapted from
the open-source artwork repository **[unknown-horizons/gfx](https://github.com/unknown-horizons/gfx)**
by the **Unknown Horizons** project and its contributors (including *janexx / Jana Weigel*,
*dauerflucher*, *unknownscribe*, *viktorias*, *kaschte*, *andymender*, and *eoc*).

Accordingly, the graphical representations and visual designs derived from `unknown-horizons/gfx`
are licensed under the **Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported License (CC BY-SA 3.0)**:

- **Source Repository**: https://github.com/unknown-horizons/gfx
- **License Terms**: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/legalcode

You are free to share and adapt the graphical designs under the terms of CC BY-SA 3.0,
provided appropriate credit is given to the Unknown Horizons project and contributors and
any derivative artwork is distributed under the same or a compatible license.
